from numbers

world towns/move_bath
world towns/move_brighton
world towns/town

kind world [ + is_happier_than: world ]

rule happier: world a is_happier_than world b if
  count (in a: person p feels happy) > count (in b: person p feels happy)

? move_bath is_happier_than move_brighton
? world w is_happier_than town
? in move_bath: harbor.lives_in
? in town: person p feels happy
? move_bath = move_brighton
? town = town
? (in move_bath: harbor feels happy) and not (in town: harbor feels happy)
